{"id":"3e1b157d1878fe48","group":"58","path":"58/batch04/58-df-zfc-model10-correct-cardinal-computation.md","title":"ZFC Model10 Correct Cardinal Computation","display":"df-zfc-model10-correct-cardinal-computation — ZFC Model10 Correct Cardinal Computation","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-model10-correct-cardinal-computation","aliases":["58-df-zfc-model10-correct-cardinal-computation"],"display":"df-zfc-model10-correct-cardinal-computation — ZFC Model10 Correct Cardinal Computation","depends_on":["[[../batch13/58-df-transitive.md]]","[[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]]","[[../batch18/58-df-bijective.md]]","[[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-model10-correct-cardinal-computation"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-model10-correct-cardinal-computation</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-model10-correct-cardinal-computation — ZFC Model10 Correct Cardinal Computation"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"2d9fd66bae7ead5a\" href=\"?note=2d9fd66bae7ead5a\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-transitive.md\">../batch13/58-df-transitive.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md\">../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d583890235faf0d5\" href=\"?note=d583890235faf0d5\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-bijective.md\">../batch18/58-df-bijective.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md\">../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Transitive}(M)\">\\(\\mathrm{Transitive}(M)\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\\in M\">\\(\\kappa\\in M\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"2d9fd66bae7ead5a\" href=\"?note=2d9fd66bae7ead5a\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-transitive.md\">../batch13/58-df-transitive.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md\">../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Bijective}\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{Bijective}\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ordinal}\\subseteq V\">\\(\\mathrm{Ordinal}\\subseteq V\\)</span> (see dependencies)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcModel10CorrectCardinalComputation}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcModel10CorrectCardinalComputation}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}model10\\text{-}correct\\text{-}cardinal\\text{-}computation}\n\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcModel10CorrectCardinalComputation}_S(M,\\kappa)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Transitive}(M)\\land\\kappa\\in M\\land\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\kappa)\\land\\left(\\neg\\exists\\alpha\\in\\kappa\\;\\exists f\\in M\\;\\mathrm{Bijective}(f,\\alpha,\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}model10\\text{-}correct\\text{-}cardinal\\text{-}computation}\n\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcModel10CorrectCardinalComputation}_S(M,\\kappa)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Transitive}(M)\\land\\kappa\\in M\\land\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\kappa)\\land\\left(\\neg\\exists\\alpha\\in\\kappa\\;\\exists f\\in M\\;\\mathrm{Bijective}(f,\\alpha,\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>For a transitive set model, internal cardinality is expressed by the absence in <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span> of a bijection from a smaller ordinal; this is compared directly with ambient cardinality without mixing object and metalanguage satisfaction.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch13/58-df-transitive.md","status":"resolved","id":"2d9fd66bae7ead5a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-transitive.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-bijective.md","status":"resolved","id":"d583890235faf0d5","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-bijective.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5582a281f15a33c2","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-transitive.md","status":"resolved","id":"2d9fd66bae7ead5a","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Transitive}(M)$ and $\\kappa\\in M$ (see [[../batch13/58-df-transitive.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{Transitive}(M)","display":false},{"tex":"\\kappa\\in M","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Bijective}\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ordinal}\\subseteq V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcModel10CorrectCardinalComputation}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}model10\\text{-}correct\\text{-}cardinal\\text{-}computation}\n\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcModel10CorrectCardinalComputation}_S(M,\\kappa)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Transitive}(M)\\land\\kappa\\in M\\land\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\kappa)\\land\\left(\\neg\\exists\\alpha\\in\\kappa\\;\\exists f\\in M\\;\\mathrm{Bijective}(f,\\alpha,\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\right).","display":true},{"tex":"M","display":false}],"bytes":1542,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-2716","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-df-zfc-model10-correct-cardinal-computation.md|58-df-zfc-model10-correct-cardinal-computation]]（batch04）"}],"outgoing":["2d9fd66bae7ead5a","5fb1c2241d1943d1","d583890235faf0d5","5582a281f15a33c2"]}